{"id":"n24052-1-8","stage":2,"title":"음식물 · 食物","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24052-1-8-1","ko":"목이 아프다더니 좀 어때?","zh":"听说你喉咙疼，现在怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목이","meaning":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","explanation":"목：喉咙，嗓子，咽喉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"2","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목이","audio":"/audio/12ba5841dcaa9b5a4d16.mp3"}},{"text":"아프다더니","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프다더니","audio":"/audio/449b9c98e08f357690bc.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"在脖子内部通向体内的深深的洞。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"i